OL,3,ABrazilians choosing between Lula and
OL,4,ABolsonaro's son in presidential
OL,5,Aelection run-off
OL,6,
OL,7,FBolsonaro is the son of former
OL,8,Fpresident Jair Bolsonaro, who was given
OL,9,Fa 27-year prison sentence for a failed
OL,10,Fcoup after losing the 2022 election,
OL,11,Fand is now under house arrest
OL,13,FArriving at a polling station in Rio de
OL,14,FJaneiro early this morning, Bolsonaro
OL,15,Ftold reporters the "time has come for
OL,16,Freal change"
OL,18,FMeanwhile, Lula greeted supporters
OL,19,Foutside a polling station as he cast
OL,20,Fhis vote in Sao Bernardo do Campo
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
